{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0023_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9b711d381fd9d0577af659d65449e3b8373ed01a0d369c8d40c3b9c8a81781f4", "ja": "お疲れさま、ひなた。\n今日は、広告用の撮影だけど……衣装、どうだ？", "zh": "辛苦你了，日向。\n今天的工作是拍摄广告……服装还好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0023_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "d4a854212dd40b18afbbcf7064c4d34f1de96166400aef2f0e2626de9b451d8d", "ja": "なんだかまだ、信じられないべさ。\nあたしに、こったら蝶みたいにキラキラした衣装……。", "zh": "总觉得很难以置信哪。\n我居然穿着这身像蝴蝶一样，闪闪发光的服装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
