{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0023_1003_p", "source_sha256": "0f386a64fa4544f68ae2a2f911eb8e8031a8bdee499b7a20182335d7492bcbaf", "ja": "そんなことないぞ。\n蝶の衣装も、ひなたによく似合ってた。", "zh": "没那回事啦。\n蝴蝶风格的服装也很适合日向。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0023_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "945ab6b4a2d9b5212af3594d220377bb4fb00401c4d8521dba042b8526edd51f", "ja": "えへへ……{$P$}に、\nそったらこと言われたら、あたし……。", "zh": "嘿嘿……被{$P$}这么一说，\n我啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
