{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0023_1006_p", "source_sha256": "cf9444f3adfef332748908c55fbab25aa0b45aa53b668fd2449b998a3d882b22", "ja": "はは、空に飛んでいかれたら困るな。\nじゃあ、ひとつ頼みがあるんだけど、いいか？", "zh": "哈哈，要是你飞上天去，我就伤脑筋了。\n那我有件事想拜托你，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0023_1007_035hin", "source_sha256": "d882134279c6df75bff1060b6b697c0f45edb378b8f19171513bb6f901166173", "ja": "うん、いいよぉ。\n今なら、空だって飛べる気がするべさ！", "zh": "嗯，可以啊。\n现在的话，感觉要我飞上天也行哪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
